{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an unfamiliar place with no memory. With no clue where the escape lies, you find yourself trapped in an endless time loop where your past actions accumulate as fragments of memory. By gathering these pieces, you uncover your true identity and seek the key to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929110/extras/fdf33544b18da292c9e96de561211fb3.avif?t=1756119477\" width=1600 height=904 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EGO :: Exit Protocol is a 2D narrative adventure game focused on exploration and puzzle-solving without combat. Players restore memories and progress by collecting clues and solving puzzles, leading to two different possible endings based on their choices and discoveries.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929110/extras/9e8488d5601402df18a1b45215ffac99.avif?t=1756119477\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929110/extras/1fe8ecaf0c7e6a5280ccef5bc1788d2b.avif?t=1756119477\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by the &quot;EGO&quot; chapter of GOINGSEVENTEEN.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\uc5ec\uae34 \uc5b4\ub514..?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929110/432d0b7fc0252a044fa267ad2aaf584d7ecffdbd.jpg"},{"name":"\ub370\uc790\ubdf0?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929110/953e41460a5f8b091337e95f1e78d50ef4d4768f.jpg"},{"name":"\ubc15\uc0ac\uc758 \uc815\uccb4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929110/ea2b8d81e636d8a